# GitHub Linguist doesn't know the `.my` extension yet — it misdetected
# .my files as CLIPS. We map to Common-Lisp (closest Lisp family language
# Linguist recognises) until MyLisp is registered upstream via a Linguist PR.
# *.lisp stays explicitly Common-Lisp to distinguish from Emacs-Lisp default.
*.my linguist-language=Common-Lisp
*.lisp linguist-language=Common-Lisp
